    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a robot working in a factory to recycle power, but every time you move, you also cost power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Either absorb all power around you endlessly, or be thinkful to plan your\u00a0route,\u00a0making every effort to\u00a0pull through the energy crisis, and finding your way out this factory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Instruction</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WSAD - Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z - Undo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >R - Restart</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc - Bact to title</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click an adjacent robot to absorb power.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a robot working in a factory to recycle power, but every time you move, you also cost power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Either absorb all power around you endlessly, or be thinkful to plan your\u00a0route,\u00a0making every effort to\u00a0pull through the energy crisis, and finding your way out this factory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Instruction</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WSAD - Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z - Undo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >R - Restart</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc - Bact to title</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click an adjacent robot to absorb power.</p></li></ul>",
